    "en": {
      "name": "Yakusugi Land",
      "description": "Yakusugi Land is a managed nature park on Yakushima featuring well-maintained boardwalk trails through groves of thousand-year-old yakusugi cedars. With trails ranging from 30 minutes to 2.5 hours, it's the most accessible way to experience the island's ancient forest without the full-day Jomon Sugi commitment. Several massive named cedar trees are highlights along the paths.",
